+// A reasonable email check, not a full RFC 5322 parser: exactly one "@", no spaces, a non-empty local part of at most 64 characters, and a domain of at least two dot-separated ASCII labels ending in a letter-only top-level domain of two or more characters. Unicode domains are rejected. Total length is at most 254 characters.
